<p>Your grappling hook is tipped with vicious, venomous barbs. Creatures struck by it will be hit for 100% unarmed damage, bleed for <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">34, 36, 39, 42, 46</acronym> physical damage and be poisoned for <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">34, 36, 39, 42, 46</acronym> nature damage over 4 turns.</p>